COMPILATION OF: E49H6

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E49H6

   1 a 0000 E49H6:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 a 0006   /* [E2E-49/P4] `s2 <= rec.na' -- BARE LEFT unequal extent,
   4 a 0006      SWAPPED weak relation; the bare twin of Panel C's I5 (`rec.s2
   5 a 0006      <= rec.na').  H-B-invis: swap loads na first, `06 03 / 3E 02',
   6 a 0006      JC da.  Completion of the bare/qualified pair for the unequal-
   7 a 0006      extent weak cell. */
   8 c 0006   dcl
   9 c 0006     1 rec,
  10 c 0006       2 na char(3),
  11 c 0006       2 nb char(3),
  12 c 0006       2 s2 char(2);
  13 c 0006   dcl k fixed bin(15);
  14 c 0006   if s2 <= rec.na then k = 1;
  15 c 001E   put list('K=', k);
  16 c 0040   stop;
  17 a 0043 end E49H6;

CODE SIZE = 0043
DATA AREA = 000C
FREE SYMS = 3888
END  COMPILATION
